## Authentication

See [SECURITY.md](SECURITY.md) for the security model.
{%- if 'auth-api-key' in components %} Create a key's configuration entry with
`uv run {{ package_name }} hash-api-key --name <client> --scope examples:read`, and send the key in
the `X-API-Key` header.
{%- else %} Configure `{{ package_name|upper }}_OIDC_ISSUER`, `_OIDC_AUDIENCE`, and `_OIDC_JWKS_URL`,
and send `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.
{%- endif %} `GET /api/v1/me` shows the authenticated caller.
{%- endif %}

## Development

| Task | Command |
| --- | --- |
| Run tests with coverage | `uv run pytest` |
| Lint | `uv run ruff check .` |
| Format | `uv run ruff format .` |
| Type-check | `uv run mypy {{ package_name }}` |
| Build sdist and wheel | `uv build` |
| Install git hooks | `uvx pre-commit install` |

{% if 'container' in components -%}
## Container

```bash
docker build -t {{ project_name }} .
docker run --rm -p 8000:8000 -e {{ package_name|upper }}_ALLOWED_HOSTS='["localhost"]' {{ project_name }}
```

Docker is optional: nothing in development or the tests needs it.

