## Project layout

```
{{ package_name }}/
  api/             # HTTP: routers, request/response schemas, dependencies, errors, middleware
  application/     # use cases (services) that orchestrate the domain through ports
  domain/          # entities, rules, errors, and ports (Protocols); no framework imports
  infrastructure/  # adapters implementing the ports{% if 'database' in components %} (database/ for SQLAlchemy){% endif %}
{%- if 'auth' in components %}
  security/        # principal, scopes, authenticator, audit, rate-limit seam
{%- endif %}
  bootstrap/       # settings, logging, the service container, create_app()
{%- if 'database' in components %}
migrations/        # Alembic revisions
{%- endif %}
tests/unit/        # domain, use cases, and adapters in isolation
tests/integration/ # real request paths through the application
```

